  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v4.1.0: first release. Dependency bundle only - it adds no types of its own and exists so a single-process application can install the whole in-process LinKit stack in one reference. It also ships the LINKITENGINE001 build guard, which warns when the bundle is mixed with individual LinKit packages because a direct reference overrides the version the bundle supplies. LinKit.Messaging.Kafka and LinKit.Messaging.RabbitMQ are deliberately excluded: add the one your process actually publishes to. Full documentation & release notes: https://quoclinh.id.vn/docs/linkit",
